### 1. Rinat: получить токен
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/logistics/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=logistics-cli&username=rinat&password={{demoPassword}}

> {% client.global.set("rinat_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### 2. Sofia: получить токен
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/logistics/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=logistics-cli&username=sofia&password={{demoPassword}}

> {% client.global.set("sofia_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### 3. Admin: получить токен
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/logistics/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=logistics-cli&username=admin&password={{demoPassword}}

> {% client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### 4. Rinat создаёт заявку — ожидаем 202
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": {
    "city": "Vilnius",
    "country": "Lithuania",
    "address": "Gedimino pr. 1"
  },
  "destination": {
    "city": "Berlin",
    "country": "Germany",
    "address": "Unter den Linden 1"
  },
  "weight": 12.5,
  "dimensions": {
    "length": 40,
    "width": 30,
    "height": 20
  },
  "deliveryType": "EXPRESS"
}

> {% client.global.set("shipment_id", response.body.id); %}

### 5. Rinat читает свою заявку — 200
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/shipments/{{shipment_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

### 6. Sofia читает чужую заявку — 404
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/shipments/{{shipment_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{sofia_token}}

### 7. Admin читает заявку Rinat — 200
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/shipments/{{shipment_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 8. История создания
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/shipments/{{shipment_id}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

### 9. Фильтры, сортировка и пагинация
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/shipments?status=CREATED&deliveryType=EXPRESS&page=0&size=10&sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

### 10. Статус Service B
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

### 11. Статус Service C
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

### 12. Список всех курьеров — 200
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/couriers
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

### 13. Курьер по ID — 200
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/couriers/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

### 14. Несуществующий курьер — 404
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/couriers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

### 15. Доступные курьеры — 200
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/couriers/available
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

### 16. Свои задачи — 200
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

> {% if (response.body.content.length > 0) client.global.set("task_id", response.body.content[0].id); %}

### 17. Все задачи — ADMIN
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 18. Фильтры, сортировка и пагинация задач
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tasks?status=QUEUED&currentStage=SEARCH_COURIER&page=0&size=10&sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

### 19. Задача по ID — после появления задачи в запросе 16
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tasks/{{task_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

### 20. История задачи
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tasks/{{task_id}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

### 21. Несуществующая задача — 404
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

### 22. Задача созданной заявки — повторить после асинхронной передачи A → Kafka → B
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tasks?shipmentId={{shipment_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

> {% if (response.body.content.length > 0) client.global.set("task_id", response.body.content[0].id); %}

### 23. Доставки в пути
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tasks?status=IN_TRANSIT&currentStage=CONFIRM_DELIVERY
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

### 24. Задачи, ожидающие курьера
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tasks?status=WAITING_FOR_COURIER
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

### 25. Завершённые доставки
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tasks?status=COMPLETED
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

### 26. Статистика задач — ADMIN, 200
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tasks/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 27. Статистика задач — USER, 403
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tasks/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

### 28. Остановившиеся задачи — ADMIN; выбрать retry_task_id из FAILED или COURIER_NOT_FOUND
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tasks?status=FAILED
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

> {% if (response.body.content.length > 0) client.global.set("retry_task_id", response.body.content[0].id); %}

### 29. Задачи, для которых истёк срок поиска курьера — ADMIN
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tasks?status=COURIER_NOT_FOUND
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

> {% if (response.body.content.length > 0) client.global.set("retry_task_id", response.body.content[0].id); %}

### 30. Повтор задачи — ADMIN: 202; неподходящий статус или противоречивые данные — 409
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tasks/{{retry_task_id}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 31. Повтор задачи — USER, 403
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tasks/{{task_id}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{rinat_token}}

### 32. Повтор отсутствующей задачи — ADMIN, 404
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
